{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24021","headline":"醉後重赠晦叔 · 白居易","name":"醉後重赠晦叔","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"老伴知君少，欢情向我偏。\n无论疎与数，相见輙欣然。\n各以诗成癖，俱因酒得仙。\n笑回青眼语，醉竝白头眠。\n岂是今投分，多疑宿结缘。\n人间更何事，携手送衰年。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24021.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24021","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}